      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just some additional context:\n\nThese screens are tricky since they can only contain images. Weird, I know, but that's why they haven't been exposed to the localization system. They aren't actually \"text.\" I believe this is a limitation of the VR driver we're using.\n\nWe'll see if we can come up with a work-around that's localizable, but in the meantime, hopefully this sheds some light on the anomaly.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
